[Audio:touching:Touching]
Queued by #R$A3E5 and played by #R$A3EF.
Fifteen notes, each with one cycle fewer than the one before.

#AUDIO0(touching.wav)(#INCLUDE(Touching))

In the game each note is played on a separate pass of the main loop, so the
notes are further apart than they are here.

